    "Route112_Text_1BB707": "Ouch! My legs cramped up!$",
    "Route112_Text_1BB721": "Try hiking, and I mean really\\npounding, on these mountain trails\\lwith a heavy pack weighing dozens of\\lpounds.\\pThat, my friend, will get your body\\ninto serious shape.$"
   },
   "complex": true
